  "instance_name": "objectification_of_women",
  "label": "Objectification of Women",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the broader cultural phenomenon of objectifying women by focusing on their physical attributes, particularly genital size, as a measure of worth or relationship viability. This is a form of gender-based objectification that reduces women to their bodies and reinforces patriarchal norms. The phrase 'reaches the back of her sisters throat!' is a crude example of this objectification, using a degrading metaphor to describe a woman's body.",
